    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/e0ceacd36953cef6d4e730348ca4a769.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div>In <i><strong>FAYE FALLING</strong></i> you play as a recently passed soul, unable to recall who they are, or how they died. After a chance encounter with a powerful entity, you begin <strong>an epic journey to defeat a growing darkness</strong>, while recovering your memories along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/8d12b6478b7ec2b3541bedb959b1df6e.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fun, fast-paced <strong>turn-based battles</strong> against a large variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evade damage</strong> by dodging enemy attacks in quick, snappy minigames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast powerful spells</strong> to fight your opponents and protect yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/c198f1320a46ca83d75e01064ad58489.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a diverse, ethereal world,</strong> filled with minigames, puzzles and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>optional side quests</strong> to receive rare items and gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/02e3b1eda707e0435a8d86eae0b8e309.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a <strong>path of darkness</strong>, where you'll steal, kill and grow horns, <strong>or a path of light</strong>, where you'll spread hope and sprout a glowing halo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>several strange characters</strong> along your journey; from an anxious skull, to a trio of divine angels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make significant narrative choices that'll lead you toward <strong>multiple endings</strong>. <i>(Including a hidden true ending.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock a New Game+</strong> mode with increased difficulty, and additional lore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Faye Falling is an emotional gameplay experience that explores death, suffering and meaning.</i> It was made entirely by one person; me!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/e0ceacd36953cef6d4e730348ca4a769.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div>In <i><strong>FAYE FALLING</strong></i> you play as a recently passed soul, unable to recall who they are, or how they died. After a chance encounter with a powerful entity, you begin <strong>an epic journey to defeat a growing darkness</strong>, while recovering your memories along the way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/8d12b6478b7ec2b3541bedb959b1df6e.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/6e5979701dcb12d54624b42519c88e85.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fun, fast-paced <strong>turn-based battles</strong> against a large variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evade damage</strong> by dodging enemy attacks in quick, snappy minigames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast powerful spells</strong> to fight your opponents and protect yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/c198f1320a46ca83d75e01064ad58489.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/4b4197995dd7a49993ff652a2b0b9bda.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a diverse, ethereal world,</strong> filled with minigames, puzzles and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>optional side quests</strong> to receive rare items and gear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/02e3b1eda707e0435a8d86eae0b8e309.avif?t=1752534744\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.poster.avif?t=1752534744\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.webm?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1865750/extras/89bd3cbaa78363a5fdb5093e4c7168d9.mp4?t=1752534744\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a <strong>path of darkness</strong>, where you'll steal, kill and grow horns, <strong>or a path of light</strong>, where you'll spread hope and sprout a glowing halo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet <strong>several strange characters</strong> along your journey; from an anxious skull, to a trio of divine angels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make significant narrative choices that'll lead you toward <strong>multiple endings</strong>. <i>(Including a hidden true ending.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock a New Game+</strong> mode with increased difficulty, and additional lore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Faye Falling is an emotional gameplay experience that explores death, suffering and meaning.</i> It was made entirely by one person; me!</p>",
    "short_description": "Faye Falling is a single-player, story-driven, turn-based RPG. You play as a recently deceased spirit trying to find their way in an afterlife seeped in turmoil. It is up to you to save your soul, and every soul, from the great darkness that threatens it.",
